# Anthiel desktop

Use skill **`anthiel-desktop`** for full procedures. This rule is ambient law.

## Feature layout

```
features/<feature>/
  data/schemas/  data/collections/  types/  actions/  mappers/  hooks/  components/
```

- Zod only in `data/schemas/` — inferred types in `types/`
- Named exports; `function Foo()`; no hand-roll `fetch` for collection-backed entities

## Collections

- Device-only → `localStorageCollectionOptions`
- Server-backed → `queryCollectionOptions` + Orval; session fields → `writeUpdate`
- After API change: `cd apps/desktop && bun run api:generate`

## E2E testids

```
pos-{area}-{element}[-{id}]
```

Prefer roles/labels; testids when fragile. Page objects use `getByTestId` — never CSS classes.
E2E package: `packages/e2e` (Playwright BDD, mock API via `page.route`).
